        "node_id": "n_2_834d26",
        "thought_text": "Another approach is to consider the positions of the elements in the sequence and determine how they can be rearranged to ensure that no element meets the sorted criteria. We can use dynamic programming to keep track of valid permutations and count them efficiently, taking into account the constraints of the problem.",
